---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Engineering Calculators & Unit Converters — HowNote"
  description="Use HowNote pipe calculators, nominal-size references and engineering unit converters."
>
  <section class="hero container">
    <div class="eyebrow">HowNote Tools</div>
    <h1>Engineering calculators built for repeat use.</h1>
    <p>Start with a fast calculation or conversion, then continue into the relevant size and standards reference.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="container grid tool-grid">
    <article class="card featured-card">
      <div class="eyebrow">Pipe / Tube</div>
      <h2>Pipe Weight Calculator</h2>
      <p class="muted">Calculate theoretical pipe mass from a reference size or custom OD and wall thickness.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/tools/pipe-weight-calculator">Open calculator →</a>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <div class="eyebrow">Pipe Size</div>
      <h2>DN–NPS–A Converter</h2>
      <p class="muted">Match nominal DN, NPS and regional A designations while keeping actual OD separate.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/tools/dn-nps-a-converter">Open converter →</a>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <div class="eyebrow">Length</div>
      <h2>mm–Inch Converter</h2>
      <p class="muted">Convert engineering dimensions using the exact 25.4 mm international inch.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/tools/mm-inch-converter">Open converter →</a>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <div class="eyebrow">Mass</div>
      <h2>kg–lb Converter</h2>
      <p class="muted">Convert kilograms and avoirdupois pounds for product and shipping estimates.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/tools/kg-lb-converter">Open converter →</a>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <div class="eyebrow">Pressure / Stress</div>
      <h2>MPa–PSI Converter</h2>
      <p class="muted">Convert pressure or stress values between MPa and psi with a traceable factor.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/tools/mpa-psi-converter">Open converter →</a>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
